'''Machines''' are [[object]]s that Isaac can interact with to gain a variety of rewards.

== Slot Machine ==
{{infobox entity
 | name    = Slot Machine
 | id      = 6
 | variant = 1
}}

Walking up to the '''Slot Machine''' and bumping into it will consume one penny and spin the slots. The Machine then has a chance to spawn one of its possible rewards.
Slot Machines appear naturally in {{r|Arcade}}s, {{r|Secret Room}}s, and other room layouts, and can be summoned using the {{P|X - Wheel of Fortune}} tarot card.

If the Slot Machine is caught in an explosion of any kind, it will be destroyed, yielding various rewards (see below). The Slot Machine also has a 2% chance to self-destruct after inserting a penny, in which case it drops several random pickups, {{i|A Dollar}}, or {{dlc|r+}} {{i|Portable Slot}} and becomes unusable.

The {{i|D4}} is unlocked when 30 Slot Machines are destroyed (via explosion or overloading) by Isaac.

{{Dlc|nr}} When blown up in the {{s|Dark Room}} or {{s|Chest}}, it will drop a collectible from the [[Treasure Room (Item Pool)|Treasure Room item pool]], much like {{e|Chest}}s and {{e|Locked Chest}}s.

{{I|Lucky Foot}} raises the odds by a multiplier of 1.4×. On [[hard mode]], the chances of winning at the Slot Machine are halved.
