=== Possible Rewards when Destroyed ===
When Isaac destroys a Slot Machine, there is a:

* 10% chance to drop a random [[pill]]
* 10% chance to drop a random [[trinket]]
* 0.8% chance to drop a {{e|Chest}}
* 0.792% chance to drop a {{e|Locked Chest}}
* 78.408% chance to drop 2-3 random pickup groupings; for each grouping, there is a
** 35% chance to drop 1-3 random {{e|Penny|text=Coin}}s
** 20% chance to drop a random [[heart]]
*** If {{t|Daemon's Tail}} is held, there is an 80% chance to prevent this grouping from being chosen; if prevented, another pickup grouping will be chosen instead.
*** If chosen, there is a 50% chance that this counts as 2 pickup groupings.
** 15% chance to drop a random {{e|Key}}
** 30% chance to drop a random {{e|Bomb}}

There is a 33% chance of an extra pickup grouping spawning if Isaac is holding {{t|Lucky Toe}}.

Furthermore, if the 78.408% chance to drop the pickup groupings is selected, there is a 33% chance for the following conditions to occur:

* If {{t|Ace of Spades}} is held, spawn an extra random [[card]].
* If {{t|Safety Cap}} is held, spawn an extra random [[pill]].
* If {{t|Match Stick}} is held, spawn an extra random {{e|Bomb}}.
* If {{t|Child's Heart}} is held, spawn an extra random [[heart]].
* If {{t|Rusted Key}} is held, spawn an extra random {{e|Key}}.

Note that only 1 additional item can spawn from this 33% chance. In the case of having multiple matching trinkets, the conditions are checked in order.

For debugging purposes, an init seed that spawns a Slot Machine that pays out a Dollar on the first attempt is 1236239571.
