== Fortune Telling Machine ==
{{infobox entity
 | name    = Fortune Telling Machine
 | variant = 3
}}

The '''Fortune Telling Machine''' is similar to the Slot Machine. Bumping into the Machine costs one penny, which will either display a random fortune or [[special seed]] on-screen, or cause the Machine to spawn one of its possible drops. Fortune Telling Machines appear naturally in {{r|Arcade}}s, {{r|Secret Room}}s, {{r|Super Secret Room}}s, and other room layouts, and can be summoned using the {{P|X - Wheel of Fortune}} tarot card.
The Fortune Telling Machine also has a chance to self-destruct after inserting a penny, in which case it drops several random pickups or {{i|Crystal Ball}}. {{Dlc|nr}} Like the Slot Machine, Fortune Telling Machines will also drop a random collectible item when destroyed in the {{s|Dark Room}} or {{s|Chest}}.

