== Revive Machine ==
{{infobox entity
 | dlc     = r+
 | name    = Revive Machine
 | variant = 19
}}

The '''Revive Machine''' is used in [[Repentance Co-Op|co-op]] to revive players. It will always spawn in the starting room of each floor just left of the top doorway in normal and hard mode. In greed and greedier mode it will spawn somewhere in the {{r|Shop}} of every floor.

Bumping into the Machine costs 1 cent and lowers the number displayed on the Machine by 1. Once the counter hits 0, a single player is revived at 1 and 1/2 filled hearts (1 coin heart for {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}}). If multiple players are dead, then the player who filled the Machine chooses who is revived. The Machine starts at a counter of 10 and increases in cost by 2 every time its requirement is reached.

Filling the Machine while there are no dead players will do nothing, but will reset the current counter.
