== Trivia ==
* Several messages from the Fortune Telling Machine are references to famous quotes, usually from video games:
** The message "Your princess is in another castle" is a reference to a famous quote from the 1985 NES game [[wikipedia:Super Mario Bros.|''Super Mario Bros''.]]
** The messages "It is dangerous to go alone" and "Go to the next room" are references to quotes from the 1986 NES game [[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda|''The Legend of Zelda'']]; the former is usually followed up with "Take this".
** The message "You will die" is likely a reference to a famous quote from the Philips CDi game [[wikipedia:Link: The Faces of Evil and Zelda: The Wand of Gamelon|''Zelda: The Wand of Gamelon'']].
** The message "I Feel Asleep!!!" is a reference to a famous quote from the 1988 NES game [[wikipedia:Metal Gear|''Metal Gear'']].
** The message "Look to La Luna" is a reference to a hint on how to unlock the hidden character Reptile on the 1992 game [[wikipedia:Mortal Kombat|''Mortal Kombat'']].
** The message "Come to a fork in the road - Take It" is a reference to a famous quote from baseball hall-of-famer [[wikipedia:Yogi Berra|''Yogi Berra'']].
** The message "Steven Lives" is a reference to ''Time Fcuk'', a previous game of Edmund McMillen's which is heavily referenced in Isaac.
** The message "Use bombs wisely" is a reference to a quote in [[wikipedia:Star Fox 64|''Star Fox 64'']].
** The message "MARRY AND REPRODUCE" is likely a reference to one of the billboards revealed in [[wikipedia:They Live|''They Live'']].
** The message "ASK AGAIN LATER" is one of the non-committal answers given by a [[wikipedia:Magic_8_Ball|''Magic 8 Ball'']].
* Mom's Dressing Table is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=859294029 this Steam Workshop mod] by Sinsthar.

